### Create New Job

POST {{baseUrl}}/job/create HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currency": "BDT",
  "description": "We are looking for an experienced striker to join our squad for the upcoming season.",
  "employmentType": "Full_Time",
  "latitude": 23.8103,
  "location": "Dhaka, Bangladesh",
  "longitude": 90.4125,
  "position": "Player",
  "title": "Striker Needed for Premier Division"
}


### Get Job circulars

GET {{baseUrl}}/job/circulars?page=1&limit=20&searchTerm=comp HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{player}}


### Get Job Details

GET {{baseUrl}}/job/details/69d487b9fd707ba402b6a512 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{jabir}}


### Get Club-Wise Job Posts

GET {{baseUrl}}/job/club-wise-posts HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{club}}


### Apply for a Job

POST {{baseUrl}}/job/apply HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{player}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "69d8978990ce8ab40b811f63"
}


### Get All Applications for a Job

GET {{baseUrl}}/job/applications/69d8978990ce8ab40b811f63 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{club}}


### Decline a Job Application

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/job/application/69d89a6e90ce8ab40b811f6b HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{club}}


### Accept a Job Application

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/job/application/69d89a6e90ce8ab40b811f6b HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{club}}
